  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">此模組修正了需要 Flywheel 1.0.x 的問題。將此模組加入您的模組載入器，或直接從 CurseForge 啟動器安裝。</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">版本：</span></strong></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;- 1.20.1 Forge/NeoForge/Fabric</h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;- 1.21.1 NeoForge/Fabric</h2>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">相容性：</span></strong></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;- 若您看到以下錯誤，此模組可與其他所有模組相容。</h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">請前往 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/groundpack-of-over-the-mountain-gotm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[GOTM] </a>查看多版本 .mixins 設定</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1eb32667-359b-403a-8c36-ef9261b80b2b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">自訂修復：</span></strong></h2>\n<h2>若發生下述問題，請使用版本 v.0.6.11-12.jar</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361699/description_5de20652-75d4-481e-b126-396cba2c746c.png\" alt=\"圖片\"></p>\n<p><strong>目前暫無更新計畫</strong></p>",
